        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the generator\",\"choice_text\":\"The generator must immediately transfer the hazardous waste to either: (1) a container that is in good condition and does not leak, or (2) a central accumulation area operated in compliance with § 262.16(b) or § 262.17(a).\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"scope_text\":\"If a container holding hazardous waste is not in good condition, or if it begins to leak\",\"summary\":\"Under the conditions for exemption for satellite accumulation, if a container holding hazardous waste is not in good condition, or if it begins to leak, the generator must immediately transfer the hazardous waste from this container to a container that is in good condition and does not leak, or immediately transfer and manage the waste in a central accumulation area operated in compliance with § 262.16(b) or § 262.17(a).\"}",
