        "@value": "{\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"scope_text\":\"unless § 265.17(b) of this chapter is complied with\",\"summary\":\"Under the special standards for incompatible wastes in satellite accumulation areas, incompatible wastes, or incompatible wastes and materials, (see appendix V of part 265 for examples) must not be placed in the same container, unless § 265.17(b) of this chapter is complied with.\"}",
