    {
      "@id": "urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Ae83b7297b741d59fb878775fd631eeb28a5aa35359e885bf29ca58f62f120732:3583:4349:sha256-550107a789a39b05daf6d654b4cc71a83fd2335b6be4bc16f0ec073961eb9a9b",
      "@type": "rkaf:SourceFragment",
      "oa:hasSource": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:e83b7297b741d59fb878775fd631eeb28a5aa35359e885bf29ca58f62f120732",
      "rkaf:fragmentIdentityScheme": "rkaf:carrier-local-fragment",
      "rkaf:sourceArtifactDigest": "sha256:e83b7297b741d59fb878775fd631eeb28a5aa35359e885bf29ca58f62f120732",
      "rkaf:fragmentContentDigest": "sha256:550107a789a39b05daf6d654b4cc71a83fd2335b6be4bc16f0ec073961eb9a9b",
      "rkaf:selectorKind": [
        "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
        "oa:TextPositionSelector"
      ],
      "oa:hasSelector": [
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(6) A generator who accumulates either acute hazardous waste listed in § 261.31 or § 261.33(e) of this chapter or non-acute hazardous waste in excess of the amounts listed in paragraph (a) of this section at or near any point of generation must do the following:\n\n(i) Comply within three consecutive calendar days with the applicable central accumulation area regulations in § 262.16(b) or § 262.17(a), or\n\n(ii) Remove the excess from the satellite accumulation area within three consecutive calendar days to either:\n\n(A) A central accumulation area operated in accordance with the applicable regulations in § 262.16(b) or § 262.17(a);\n\n(B) An on-site interim status or permitted treatment, storage, or disposal facility, or\n\n(C) An off-site designated facility; and"
        },
        {
          "@type": "oa:TextPositionSelector",
          "oa:start": 3583,
          "oa:end": 4349,
          "rkaf:coordinateSystem": "rkaf:unicode-codepoint"
        }
      ]
