        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the generator\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"scope_text\":\"During the three-consecutive-calendar-day period when accumulating acute or non-acute hazardous waste in excess of the amounts listed in paragraph (a)\",\"summary\":\"When a generator accumulates acute hazardous waste listed in § 261.31 or § 261.33(e) or non-acute hazardous waste in excess of the amounts listed in § 262.15(a) at or near any point of generation, during the three-consecutive-calendar-day period the generator must continue to comply with paragraphs (a)(1) through (5) of § 262.15.\"}",
